# Un'Goro Crater, Alliance 50, part 2 of the crater (consensus visit 56, the level 50 quests).
# Flow: Marshal's Refuge -> the gorilla pelts on Ironstone Plateau -> Ringo on Fire Plume Ridge -> his escort
# back to the refuge.
# Order changes against the simulator, same quest set over the three crater guides:
# - The export's grind to 50 on Ironstone Plateau now sits in 07, before the level 55 quests it unlocks; this
#   part starts at 50.
# - The Apes of Un'Goro's pelts (4289, accepted in 07) are collected here; Torwa takes them in 50-60/01.
# - A Little Help From My Friends (4491) starts Ringo's escort the moment it is accepted, so the escort and the
#   turn-in follow at once here instead of after the level 51 grind.
# - Beware of Pterrordax (4501) was taken and turned in in 07.
# Class quests: none in this visit.
guide forever/alliance/40-50/08-un-goro-crater
title Un'Goro Crater
faction Alliance
levels 50-51
zone Un'Goro Crater
next forever/alliance/50-60/01-un-goro-crater

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lost!

step Spraggle Frock
  tip Spraggle's friend Ringo has gone missing.
  accept 4492

step Ironstone Plateau
  tip The gorillas live on Ironstone Plateau, east of Marshal's Refuge. Keep their pelts for Torwa Pathfinder. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha is level 55.
  collect 11478 quest 4289            -- Un'Goro Gorilla Pelt
  collect 11479 quest 4289            -- Un'Goro Stomper Pelt
  collect 11480 quest 4289            -- Un'Goro Thunderer Pelt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ringo

step Ringo
  tip Ringo sits on the south-east slope of Fire Plume Ridge, in the middle of the crater.
  turnin 4492
  accept 4491

step Escort Ringo
  tip Lead Ringo north to Marshal's Refuge. When he faints, use Spraggle's Canteen on him to wake him.
  complete 4491

step Spraggle Frock
  turnin 4491
